    "That's the whole idea: at a random time, MimoDays sends a notification. Drop what you're doing and, wherever you are, capture what's around you right away, just as it is. Busy? Skip it. No streaks, no penalties." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding OB-02: the app's main idea; a notification comes, you stop and capture at once",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That's the whole idea: at a random time, MimoDays sends a notification. Drop what you're doing and, wherever you are, capture what's around you right away, just as it is. Busy? Skip it. No streaks, no penalties."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the heart of MimoDays. At a random time within your hours, a notification comes. Drop what you're doing and, wherever you are, capture what's around you right away, just as it is: a real piece of an ordinary day, not a perfect shot." : {
      "comment" : "Help › Surprises: the app's main idea",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is the heart of MimoDays. At a random time within your hours, a notification comes. Drop what you're doing and, wherever you are, capture what's around you right away, just as it is: a real piece of an ordinary day, not a perfect shot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the notification and the camera opens at once. A surprise stays open for a while, 15 minutes unless you change it; what you capture in that time is marked Surprise." : {
